      "text": "[9:10PM] #Ojo #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic from Agbara to Iyana Era is moving steadily.\nIyana Era to Afromedia is flowing well, and Afromedia to Volks is a smooth ride.\nIyana Iba Flyover is moving fast towards Mile2 and good flow underneath to Igando. Volks to Barracks and Barracks to Abule Ado are also moving well, with no impediments reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
